    },
    "body": "A later-fragment failure had no credit in the prior objective. This adds a bounded shared Prefix-coefficient learning path from the original parent, preserving the frozen Source/Cue/Context/Generate/U families and the existing serving mechanism. It also adds an artifact-only entry point to the existing own-feedback evaluator.\n\nThe fixed-prefix construction corrected target 267 at row 245 position 4 and retained all 17 declared reference winners. Independent saved arithmetic verified 427 accepted coefficient proposals and the coherent export/reload. Actual own-feedback qualification failed: only 7/8 original complete replies were retained, row 13 first diverged at position 7, and target row 245 first diverged at position 2 before the corrected boundary. The candidate remains unselected. No useful conversation, transfer, or geometric advantage is claimed.\n\nMeasured model execution and qualification remain bound to source commits 995d4197 and 8173d529 respectively, with sealed reports, authentic original fractional Prefix weights, independently reviewed results and fresh-download-verified private preservation. Final exact-head scoped Rust checks will be posted before queueing. Historical transport checks are compatibility acknowledgements only.\n\nReferences #820. The next dependency is a causal comparison at the two identical first-divergence prefixes, after actual protected delivery. No repeat fit, broad evaluation, cursor or serving cases are authorized by this result.",
